    "body": "CloseWatchers only operate on fully active documents, their subroutines will return early if the document isn't fully active, but they don't assert.\r\n\r\nThis is more to do with the open dialogs list, which should ideally only contain open dialogs. If we don't run cleanup steps then we can get into a position where non-open dialogs are in the open dialogs list.",
    "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:02:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-25T10:02:13Z",
